abstract: >-
  An object-oriented Python implementation of the lumped conceptual HBV rainfall-runoff model,
  with calibration (Nelder-Mead or DDS), Monte Carlo uncertainty analysis, and a Model Context
  Protocol (MCP) server that lets AI agents set up, calibrate and diagnose the model.
